                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1][b][u]Overall - 42/100[/u][/b][/h1]\nOoof...it's bad.  Gameplay is pretty non-existent, and there's zero polish applied to anything.\n\n[h1]Playing as a cat - 20/20[/h1] \nYes!\n\n[h1]Acting like a cat - 20/20[/h1]\nThe game does do this right.  You walk around in your house or just outside it, and do cute cat stuff.  You can \"act cute at the bus stop\" to make meow coins!  You can eat food and scratch things you aren't supposed to scratch -- classic cat stuff!\n\n[h1]Adorableness Level - 2/20[/h1]\nIt's a little cute, but you'd get the same level of cute from looking at a picture of the cat on the internet.  So you should do that instead.\n\n[h1]Polish - 0/20[/h1]\nControls are bad, animations are worse, and the English translation is the worst of all.\n\n[h1]FUN! - 0/20[/h1]\nThey've provided all the trappings of a game - an inventory, items, stats and attributes, interactions with other characters, an intro story...but there doesn't seem to be any actual game.  There are a couple very small areas where you walk and try not to starve to death.  That's it.  See if you can stick with it long enough to get a couple acheivements out of it--I sure couldn't.",
